    "title": "What time does new episode of 'The Pitt' come out? How to watch",
    "text": "April 16, 2026, 3:00 p.m. ETIf you are hooked on the hit television show “The Pitt” get ready for a new episode on the horizon.Season 2 of the HBO show is nearing its end but the award-winning series has a new episode coming out. Here is everything you need to know about the latest release.What time do 'The Pitt' episodes come out?Episode 15 of the “The Pitt” comes out on Thursday, April 9 at 9 p.m. Eastern time. New episodes air at the same time every Thursday, but tonight marks the season finale.Where can I watch 'The Pitt'Season 1 and 2 of “The Pitt” are available for streaming on the platform HBO Max. A subscription is necessary to stream the show.The basic plan with ads costs $10.99/month or $109.99/year. Other subscription plans are available.How many episodes of 'The Pitt' are in season 2?“The Pitt” Season 2 will have 15 episodes. The finale of Season 2 is set to come out on April 16, 2026.'The Pitt' season finale in theatersThe season finale will also be shown in select Alamo Drafthouse movie theaters, Variety reported. Check a location near you for showing details.What is 'The Pitt' about?“The Pitt” takes place in a fictional hospital in Pittsburgh. The unique series showcases the life of a nurses working a 15-hour shift. Each episode covers one hour of the shift.",
